WEBVTT

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.030
Are you okay?

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.900
Yes, Master.

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:18.580
Sounds like the battle against the King is starting.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:23.960
Considering the timing,
it must be Sakura challenging the King.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:26.830
Hey!

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.040
Master!

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:41.060
Iora.

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:43.600
Let's go.

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:17.490
#10 A Wish

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:19.450
Accept.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:21.450
Rabbian, Moonlight.

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:23.120
Attacking the player.

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:24.740
Blocking with Grona.

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:30.540
Using Rabbian's ability to convert life into Energy.

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:33.000
Using Johanna to attack the player.

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:41.180
Shot Trigger. Cage of Reason.

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.550
Returning Johanna to your hand.

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:46.390
Hm? Is that it?

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:49.270
End of turn.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:49.850
Listen.

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:54.570
They say that cherry blossom petals turn pink...

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:58.650
Because there's a corpse buried under the tree's roots.

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:02.700
It absorbs the corpse's blood
so that the tree can blossom.

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:06.370
Doesn't that sound like someone we know?

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:09.620
Using Teruto and stomping all over him.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:12.670
To ensure that your own wish would be granted.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.630
How vicious is that?

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:18.630
Tell me. Why did you choose Teruto?

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:22.640
I saw that he had the potential to complete the key.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:25.350
Is that what you believe?

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:25.930
What?

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:27.720
End of turn.

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:30.730
<i>She's not attacking.</i>

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:33.060
<i>She's barely made any moves up to now.</i>

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:34.690
<i>Does she have something up her sleeve?</i>

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.360
Draw.

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:38.110
Teruto will never forgive you.

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.860
You don't have to tell me that.

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.860
I just wanted the chips.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:46.120
It didn't have to be Teruto.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:52.370
I'm sure that it was because of Teruto
that I was able to get this far, though.

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:58.590
I get it. Even if I manage to regain my body...

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.800
I can't be with those two again in the future.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:05.800
So at least, I have to win.

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:09.770
At least. At least. If it's the last thing I do.

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:13.270
Annihilate everything in your path.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:15.060
Accept.

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:20.610
TX-07 Dio Sirius. Iora.

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:24.280
Territory. Build Arise.

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:33.330
Gladsheim Megiddrag.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:37.670
Hey, that's an Assault Territory.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:46.300
Her Territory became a unit. Amazing, no?

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:50.350
Activating Iora's ability.

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:51.600
Scout Three.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:54.730
Using Iora to attack the player.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.480
Activating ability during the attack.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:05:00.570
From my deck, playing the Command,
Beast King's Rage.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:04.740
Megiddrag will copy all Command Cards targeting it.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.320
Trading damage with Grona.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:11.450
Fire.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:18.920
Using Megiddrag to attack the player.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:31.810
End of turn.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:34.520
My turn.

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:36.440
Accept.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:39.060
Riley, Twin Angel of Punishment.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:42.980
End of turn.

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:45.150
Are you just screwing around?

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:46.700
Why aren't you taking this seriously?

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:48.860
Was it fun being with Teruto?

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:49.990
What?

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.830
It was fun, wasn't it?

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:58.710
Teruto's always so absent-minded.

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:02.170
But when he sees bread,
his eyes just light up, right?

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:05.340
That face like a child, it's so cute.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:08.220
He may not look it, but he's super kind.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:13.600
Even if he says it's a pain,
he'll come to your rescue if you need him.

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:18.770
Right. He does do that.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:20.480
Huh?

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:23.360
What do you know about it?

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:28.700
Who was Teruto to you?

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:30.820
What?

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:36.040
I know that I needed Teruto,
but what did Teruto need?

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:38.330
Was it for bread?

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:40.540
Was I just his guide?

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.170
Maybe...

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:46.590
<i>You're always looking out for me.</i>

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:49.380
<i>So, I was worried about you.</i>

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:51.930
<i>It's all thanks to you.</i>

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:55.810
But I didn't do anything.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:58.020
You're the one who did all the work.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:06:59.690
All I did was stay by your side.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:03.480
I thought we met by chance.

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.650
But maybe it was fate.

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:09.700
Using Iora to attack the player.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.660
Using Megiddrag to attack the player.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:20.370
Shot Trigger. Angelic Order.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:25.380
Consuming two Conviction Counters,
then checking the top of my deck.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:28.420
If it's a Judgment unit, I'll send it to the field.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.220
Helmina, Angel of Oblivion. Accept.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.930
I can't get to her lives.

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:36.680
What do you mean, fate?

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:39.890
I'm the one who has your fate in my hands.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:42.100
Playtime's over.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:46.520
Putting everything in the universe on a scale.

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:49.190
Thou who brings judgment upon others.

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.910
Margreia, Angel of Justice.

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.620
Territory. Build Arise.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:15.390
Shrine of Justice.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:20.810
There are two powers carved into this shrine.

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:25.020
As for what kinds of powers,
you can look forward to it.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:29.940
Oh, Kikka has a new Territory too, Higuma.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:31.190
Huh?

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:46.080
Has the tide turned?

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:52.170
I'm going to convict everything about you.

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.510
Using Riley to attack Iora.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:57.680
Using Helmina to attack Megiddrag.

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.470
Blocking with Nadiya.

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:00.510
You can't escape.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:03.270
Using Margreia to attack Megiddrag.

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:31.090
All of your units are gone.

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:33.510
You really are alone.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:37.300
You were born all alone,
and you'll disappear all alone.

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:49.980
I still have plenty of lives.

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:51.610
I'm all right.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:52.440
I won't lose.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:54.400
Johanna, Accept.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:57.280
Once again, Iora. Accept.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:03.200
With Iora on the field,
I'm releasing my Territory again.

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:12.090
Using Megiddrag's power, I'm up on my feet again.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.000
Using Iora's Scout Three.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:19.300
When Riley attacks, I'm playing the Command
from my deck, Beast King's Rage.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.300
Then, I'm using Megiddrag to copy it.

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.600
Targeting Helmina and Riley.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.230
Activating Margreia's ability.

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:28.770
Converting the damage Riley takes to zero.

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:29.520
Not yet.

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:31.060
Megiddrag.

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:34.860
Iora.

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:38.200
Using Johanna to attack the player.

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:42.320
End of turn.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:49.250
Hm?

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:53.670
Looks like they've arrived.

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:02.220
We made it this far, but...

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:04.100
How do we get in?

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:12.900
Using Margreia to attack the player.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:15.150
Blocking with Megiddrag.

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:18.280
End of turn, then.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:19.990
My turn.

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.200
What's the matter?

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.950
Don't like the card you drew?

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:31.960
You were just on a roll.

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:37.000
You used Megiddrag to block me,
and now you don't have a single unit left.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:39.340
Looks like you're at the end of your rope.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:41.470
End of turn.

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:43.640
You're so predictable.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:47.100
Activating Epitaph of Conviction's ability.

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:52.270
Revealing the top card of my deck.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:55.270
If it's a Judgment card, I'll add it to my hand.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:58.110
You're only ahead in number of lives.

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:05.030
But every time you launch a unit,
I'll use Epitaph of Conviction to increase my power.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:09.040
How agonizing.

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.460
Why don't we set the record straight?

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:19.670
You keep claiming that you're the owner of this body.

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:22.090
Do you even have any memories of it?

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:29.180
Do you remember walking
hand in hand together with Teruto?

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:36.770
This is the scar you got playing
with Teruto in the yard as kids.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:38.940
Of course you remember, right?

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:45.570
The reason why Teruto loves croissants.
You remember that, right?

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:52.660
Accept.

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:55.290
Elizabelt, Angel of Law.

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:56.750
Activating ability.

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:58.710
Sending Grona to the field.

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:03.380
Launching a Two-Hit Attack
with Elvieu, Angel of Embrace.

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:07.850
Shot Trigger. Surprise Attack.

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.890
Resting Elizabelt.

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:12.060
Elvieu's second hit.

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:16.310
When you see your blood sibling,
you should feel something.

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:18.150
Not to mention, you're twins.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:23.900
Tell me. When you met Teruto,
what did you think? Feel?

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:31.990
You can't feel anything, anyway.

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:37.040
You can't even eat or sleep, a little doll.

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:42.630
I'm not a doll.

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:45.970
Using Margreia's ability to decrease Elvieu's damage.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.640
I'll let you in on the truth now.

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:54.100
You were born from within me.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:58.100
What you think are your memories,
are actually my memories.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:01.480
You just spilled out from me, nothing more.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:02.940
Just dregs.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:06.610
Gain your body so you can live on?

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:08.410
That will never happen.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:14.290
I know.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:15.540
Huh?

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:19.120
I always knew that.

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:23.500
I'm not like others.
Just a being that doesn't exist.

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:29.390
Even if I try, I'm destined to just disappear.

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:31.220
You...

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:34.560
But I don't want to just give up.

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:39.140
Even if the odds are one in a million,
I want to bet on it.

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:42.190
I'm having my wish granted, no matter what.

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:51.620
It's not budging at all.

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:53.530
Sakura.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:56.500
Looks like you could use a hand.

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:58.620
Who are you, old man?

00:14:58.910 --> 00:14:59.870
You're...

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.880
I don't mind helping you out.

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:06.420
First though, answer me this.

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:10.720
Who do you want to see...

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:13.430
The flower bearing the colors of your past?

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:16.270
Or the flower that showed you your future?

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:17.770
Which one?

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:19.890
I...

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:22.100
Sakura.

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.570
I take it that's your answer?

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:28.530
Take me to the throne.

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:30.860
Are you sure you're ready?

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:33.280
It could vanish this time.

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:36.700
Your existence from this world.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.040
Teruto...

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:40.960
Master.

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:45.790
Take me there. Where Sakura is.

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:50.880
You humans sure are entertaining, you know?

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:56.220
Command. Shackle of Ethics.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:57.970
Targeting Zophia.

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:01.310
There's no way your wish will ever be granted.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:04.480
No matter what,
you'll just be absorbed by me and disappear.

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:07.400
Then why did you create me?

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.190
Huh?

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:12.610
You had a wish you wanted so badly,
that you created me.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.990
Was it ever granted?

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.330
It has nothing to do with you.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:26.290
I see. You missed Teruto...

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.630
If at least your soul could be near Teruto—

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:33.430
Shut up. Launching a Two-Hit Attack with Elvieu.

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:37.760
Your wish will never be granted.

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.350
Just accept it and give up already.

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:41.560
I won't give up.

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:42.520
Give up.

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:43.560
I won't give up!

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:44.520
Give up!

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:48.270
If I give up now,
Teruto's resolve will have been for nothing.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.650
Shot Trigger. Surprise Attack.

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:53.650
Resting Elizabelt.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:57.580
You're the one who trampled all over Teruto.

00:16:57.580 --> 00:17:03.040
That's right.
I had only one wish, to regain my body.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.080
It was all I lived for.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:10.130
But, one more time, I just want...

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:11.050
Sakura!

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:17.720
Why?

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:23.480
I thought I'd shake things up
by bringing in more of the cast.

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:28.270
Teruto.

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:30.230
Sakura, you have to stop.

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:33.650
If you keep battling, you'll...

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:36.820
I know what my fate is.

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:39.620
But I'm going to fight until the bitter end.

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.450
That is my path.

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:43.700
As well as...

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:46.080
My penalty for betraying you all.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:47.670
Sakura...

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:52.170
Ishinome told me everything about you.

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:54.670
But I don't give a damn.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:59.680
But... but I... my body is fake.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:01.350
You are you.

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:06.850
Since I've been here,
you're the one who's shown me my path.

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:09.770
Thank you, Sakura.

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:17.700
<i>I've been wondering.</i>

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:21.120
<i>Why was I born?</i>

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:27.410
<i>If my purpose was to find a star like you...</i>

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:31.250
<i>Maybe my song reached you?</i>

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.970
Teruto. I...

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:42.510
Teruto belongs to me!

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:43.430
Using Margreia—

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:44.470
Kikka.

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:47.940
This match is over. Let Sakura go.

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:52.730
Why? Are you saying you'd choose a girl
who's going to disappear over me?

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:53.980
No, it's not.

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:58.280
Sakura was born with her own soul. That's why...

00:18:58.280 --> 00:18:59.530
It's all right.

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:03.950
My wish has already been granted.

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:06.160
Sakura?

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:10.120
I hope you're ready. Margreia.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:13.340
Sakura.

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:15.250
Two-Hit Attack.

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:21.640
Sakura!

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:25.260
I'm glad I got to see you all again.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:27.730
Thanks.

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:31.730
Teruto.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:36.820
I'm sorry.

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:51.210
Sakura?

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:54.630
I can't. No way...

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:58.050
Sakura!

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:03.930
You know, I prefer things to be fun.

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:06.310
I don't like to see tears.

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:12.940
I think your tears were more human
than I've ever seen.

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:17.270
A fake is just a fake, after all.

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:26.870
She's regaining the half of the body that she lost.

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:31.830
It's flowing through me. The power is surging.

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:35.710
My blood. My cells. My soul.

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:49.100
What in the world is that?

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:53.190
I'm not sure, but I can feel how dangerous it is.

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:55.940
If it goes berserk, Neo Kyoto will...

00:20:56.360 --> 00:20:57.400
Hiyori.

00:20:58.190 --> 00:20:59.900
Hold this for me.

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:05.870
Okay.

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:10.790
Kikka.

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:13.370
Battle me.

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:16.790
Really? You want to battle with me?

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:19.710
It doesn't matter if it's a Rebuild or not.

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:22.170
This is between us as siblings.

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:25.090
I'm so happy, Teruto.

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:27.680
Then, let's battle.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:30.640
We're going to pledge between the two of us.

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:33.180
Forever.

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:38.610
Well, the time has come then?

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:45.860
The King...

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:47.990
...is shivering.

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:50.280
Now, show us.

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:54.460
Your power that can transcend dimensions.

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:59.960
TO BE CONTINUED

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:33.850
We're going to play forever. Together.

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:36.310
Then, the King is...

00:23:36.310 --> 00:23:39.230
Battle. The King.

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:39.980
#11 Heads or Tails
